 nested runtime/ infrastructure layer (formerly the separate deep-loop-runtime skill, merged 2026-07-08). research (outward web+code iterative investigation \\u2192 research/ artifacts), review (iterative review loop \\u2192 P0/P1/P2 findings + verdict), ai-council (multi-seat planning deliberation \\u2192 ai-council/ artifacts), and two improvement lanes on the deep-improvement packet (agent-improvement, model-benchmark). The hub holds no per-mode convergence, state, or synthesis logic; each mode keeps its own contract in its packet and is reachable via its /deep:* command and native agent.\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json-4-  \"version\": \"1.5.3.0\",\n--\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json-24-    \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json:25:    \"model-benchmark\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json-26-    \"benchmark-harness\",\n--\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json-10-  {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json:11:    \"workflowMode\": \"model-benchmark\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json-12-    \"leafScopes\": [\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json:13:      \"assets/model-benchmark\",\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"=== MASTER FILE LIST (outside specs, no node_modules) ===\"; rg -n -i -l -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!.git/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' . | sort; echo; echo \"=== CORE HUB TOP-LEVEL FILES ===\"; rg -n -i -C 1 -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark|loopHostMode\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ROUTER.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/command-metadata.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-manifest.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json .skilled/skills/system-de