\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:87:   │     → lane = \"model-benchmark\" → AUTO-ROUTE (see Lane B routing below).\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-88-   └─ IF neither lane signal nor an agent path present AND interactive (no :auto)\n--\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-90-\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:91:   Lane B routing: AUTO-ROUTE to the dedicated model-benchmark workflow:\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:92:   load .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep_model-benchmark_{auto,confirm}.yaml\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:93:   (see /deep:model-benchmark). Subsequent questions become the Lane B set\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-94-   (profile, outputs/spec_folder, exec, scoring_method, grader, executor+model).\n--\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-96-\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:97:2. CHECK if $ARGUMENTS contains an agent path (Lane A only; skipped when lane=model-benchmark):\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-98-   ├─ IF present (.skilled/agents/*.md) → target_path = detected value, omit Q0\n--\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-125-   │     If B, this command auto-routes to                          │\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:126:   │     /deep:model-benchmark and asks the Lane B set.) │\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-127-   │                                                                │\n--\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt-150-9. Parse response and store ALL results:\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:151:   - lane = [agent-improvement (Lane A) or model-benchmark (Lane B), resolved in step 1B / Q(lane)]\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:152:   - IF lane = model-benchmark → STOP this Lane A parse and HAND OFF to\nassets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:153:     /deep:model-benchmark using\nassets/deep-agen