{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791657922538,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74cf1ffePOKstMD2z8jRCa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_sOmYKpaJlZdn0pZfUC6E9929","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n -i -C 1 \"model.benchmark\" .skilled/commands/README.txt; echo \"EXIT=$?\"; sed -n '1,30p' .skilled/commands/README.txt; date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ"},"output":"99-│   ├── ai-council.md         # Multi-seat AI council planning\n100:│   ├── model-benchmark.md    # Model/prompt-framework benchmark loop\n101-│   ├── research.md           # Iterative deep research workflow\n--\n180-| Agent Improvement | `/deep:agent-improvement <agent_path> [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Evaluate and improve agents across 5 integration-aware dimensions |\n181:| Model Benchmark | `/deep:model-benchmark [profile] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Benchmark and optimize a model or prompt framework against fixtures |\n182-| Research Loop | `/deep:research <topic> [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Iterative technical investigation with convergence |\nEXIT=0\n---\ntitle: \"OpenCode Commands\"\ndescription: \"OpenCode slash commands: component creation, deep loops, prompts, continuity and spec kit workflows.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"opencode commands\"\n  - \"slash commands\"\n  - \"command reference\"\n  - \"available commands\"\n---\n\n# OpenCode Commands\n\n> Slash commands that provide structured workflows for component creation, deep loops, prompt improvement, packet continuity, and spec kit operations.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:table-of-contents -->\n## TABLE OF CONTENTS\n\n- [1. OVERVIEW](#1--overview)\n- [2. PURPOSE](#2--purpose)\n- [3. STRUCTURE](#3--structure)\n- [4. COMMAND GROUPS](#4--command-groups)\n- [5. INSTRUCTIONS](#5--instructions)\n- [6. USAGE](#6--usage)\n- [7. EXECUTION MODES](#7--execution-modes)\n- [8. FAQ](#8--faq)\n- [9. TROUBLESHOOTING](#9--troubleshooting)\n- [10. RELATED DOCUMENTS](#10--related-documents)\n\n2026-10-10T18:45:22Z\n","metadata":{"output":"99-│   ├── ai-council.md         # Multi-seat AI council planning\n100:│   ├── model-benchmark.md    # Model/prompt-framework benchmark loop\n101-│   ├── research.md           # Iterative deep research workflow\n--\n180-| Agent Improvement | `/deep:agent-improvement <agent_path> [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Evaluate and improve agents across 5 integration-aware dimensions |\n181:| Model Benchmark | `/deep:model-benchmark [profile] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Benchmark and optimize a model or prompt framework against fixtures |\n182-| Research Loop | `/deep:research <topic> [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Iterative technical investigation with convergence |\nEXIT=0\n---\ntitle: \"OpenCode Commands\"\ndescription: \"OpenCode slash commands: component creation, deep loops, prompts, continuity and spec kit workflows.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"opencode commands\"\n  - \"slash commands\"\n  - \"command reference\"\n  - \"available commands\"\n---\n\n# OpenCode Commands\n\n> Slash commands that provide structured workflows for component creation, deep loops, prompt improvement, packet continuity, and spec kit operations.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:table-of-contents -->\n## TABLE OF CONTENTS\n\n- [1. OVERVIEW](#1--overview)\n- [2. PURPOSE](#2--purpose)\n- [3. STRUCTURE](#3--structure)\n- [4. COMMAND GROUPS](#4--command-groups)\n- [5. INSTRUCTIONS](#5--instructions)\n- [6. USAGE](#6--usage)\n- [7. EXECUTION MODES](#7--execution-modes)\n- [8. FAQ](#8--faq)\n- [9. TROUBLESHOOTING](#9--troubleshooting)\n- [10. RELATED DOCUMENTS](#10--related-documents)\n\n2026-10-10T18:45:22Z\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rg -n -i -C 1 \"model.benchmark\" .skilled/commands/README.txt; echo \"EXIT=$?\"; sed -n '1,30p' .skilled/commands/README.txt; date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ","time":{"start":1791657922437,"end":1791657922536}},"id":"prt_127224e8a001eyWEFqciun4qK0","sessionID":"ses_ed8e74cf1ffePOKstMD2z8jRCa","messageID":"msg_127221e5a001PRAo45nGhWd61D"}}
