xed the shared/delete split before classification; the default.json fixture list pinned the exact fixture carve-out.\n- What did not work and why: nothing material.\n- What I would do differently: nothing; the carve-out rule (shared file inside a mode-named directory) should carry into iterations 7 and 9 where generated mirrors repeat the same directory shape.\n\n## Recommended Next Focus\n\nIteration 4: `system-skill-advisor` surfaces — runtime scorer `aliases.ts`, `lanes/explicit.ts`, `projection.ts`, command-bridges JSON, `skill-graph.json`, `skill_advisor.py`, shadow-diff, and any routing-registry drift guard.\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/system-deep-loop/039-deprecate-improvement-modes/001-removal-research/001-model-benchmark-inventory/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-003.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/specs/system-deep-loop/039-deprecate-improvement-modes/001-removal-research/001-model-benchmark-inventory/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-003.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/system-deep-loop/039-deprecate-improvement-modes/001-removal-research/001-model-benchmark-inventory/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-003.md","time":{"start":1791658097577,"end":1791658097583}},"id":"prt_12724d306001XRb5Oh2LYqQ6k0","sessionID":"ses_ed8e74cf1ffePOKstMD2z8jRCa","messageID":"msg_12724c17d0014RD7o1mZcfM3IP"}}
