ent/target-profiles\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:532:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/assets/model-benchmark\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:533:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/assets/model-benchmark/benchmark-profiles\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json-534-    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/benchmark\",\n--\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json-542-    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/lib\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:543:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:544:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark/lib\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:545:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark/scorer\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:546:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark/scorer/deterministic\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:547:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark/scorer/grader\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:548:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark/scorer/grader/prompts\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:549:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark/scorer/lib\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:550:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/model-benchmark/tests\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json-551-    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/shared\",\n--\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json-599-    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/mode-contracts\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:600:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/model-benchmark-ledger-schema\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:601:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/model-benchmark-reducers\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json:602:    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/model-benchmark-sealed-artifacts\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json-603-    \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/next-focus\",\n--\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/cite-drift-redirects.json-365-    {\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/cite-drift-redirects.json:366:      \"from\": \".opencode/skills/sk-prompt-small-model/benchmarks/113-005-swe-1.6-extraction-rerun/\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/cite-drift-redirects.json:367:      \"to\": \".opencode/skills/sk-prompt-small-model/benchmarks/002-swe-1.6-extraction-rerun/\",\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/cite-drift-redirects.json-368-      \"records\": 77,\n--\n\n=== readme/changelog/playbook quick ===\n7:  - \"model-benchmark\"\n22:| **Invoke with** | `/create:benchmark`, \"benchmark-report.md\", \"behavior benchmark\", \"model-benchmark\" |\n36:`create-benchmark` authors documentation and input artifacts for three benchmark families, plus a guide-only fourth lane. MCP promotion writes a `benchmark-report.md` and a `source.md` that move a shipped spec packet's results into a skill's `mcp-server/benchmarks/` tree. Behavior benchmarks get a `behavior-benchmark/` package of scenario contracts for a deep-loop mode. Model-benchmarks get Lane B fixtures and run profiles. The skill never runs a benchmark and never writes a scorer or rubric. Those stay lane-owned in deep-improvement. Start with the `/create:benchmark` command. The family router in `SKILL.md` section 2 decides which family shape applies. It is the required first stop before authoring anything.\n44:| **Model-benchmark** (`model_benchmark`, Lane B) | what a model or prompt framework produces against a held-out oracle | Lane B fixtures and run profiles at `system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/assets/model-benchmark/` |\n78:Behavior, skill and model benchmarks follow the same authoring-not-running shape. Each family has its own package layout documented in its own `SKILL.md` section (9 through 11) and its own guide under `references/`.\n151:| [`references/model-benchmark/model-benchmark-fixture-guide.md`](./references/model-benchmark/model-benchmark-fixture-guide.md) | Fixture-family taxonomy, profile shape and the Lane B scoring boundary |\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-benchmark/changelog/v1.3.0.0.md\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-benchmark/changelog/v1.2.0.0.md\n3:description: \"Operator playbook for the create-benchmark workflow across MCP promotion, behavior, model-benchmark and agent-improvement inputs.\"\n9:This playbook validates the `sk-create-benchmark` workflow as an authoring tool. It checks family routing, package shape, lane boundaries and evidence storage guidance. It does not run a benchmark or score a model.\n37:- The expected package shape or lane boundary.\n94:### BMR-005 | Match a Lane B fixture to its scorer\n96:Verify that model-benchmark inputs are data-only and that a profile uses a scorer that matches the fixture shape.\n102:## 9. EVIDENCE AND LANE BOUNDARIES (`BMR-007`)\n118:This playbook records operator-visible authoring behavior. It does not duplicate the Lane B evaluator or the behavior-benchmark framework.\n2026-10-10T18:50:36Z\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"S=\".skilled/skills/sk-doc\"; echo \"=== SKILL.md §10 tail ===\"; sed -n '500,570p' \"$S/sk-create-benchmark/SKILL.md\" | head -75; echo \"=== other files ===\"; rg -n -i -C 1 \"model.benchmark\" \"$S/sk-create-benchmark/references/shared/README.md\" \"$S/scripts/tests/code-folder/baseline-readme-verdicts.json\" \"$S/scripts/tests/code-folder/durable-directory-manifest.json\" \"$S/shared/scripts/cite-drift-redirects.json\" \"$S/manual-testing-playbook/token-cost-baseline/max-load.md\" .skilled/commands/create/assets/create-benchmark-presentation.txt \"$S/sk-create-command/assets/command-contract.json\" 2>/dev/null | head -70; echo; echo \"=== readme/changelog/playbook quick ===\"; rg -n -i \"model.benchmark\" \"$S/sk-create-benchmark/README.md\" | head; rg -n -i -l \"model.benchmark\" \"$S/sk-create-benchmark/changelog/\" ; rg -n -i \"model.benchmark|lane b\" \"$S/sk-create-benchmark/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\" | head -10; date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ","time":{"start":1791658236314,"end":1791658236398}},"id":"prt_1272715ed001bq9N0Qf5fDFVGM","sessionID":"ses_ed8e74cf1ffePOKstMD2z8jRCa","messageID":"msg_12726f361001Ld8Bs7EWgW32in"}}
