depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-81-|---|---|\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-82-| `manual-testing-playbook.md` | Root directory page and scenario summary |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md:83:| `../../SKILL.md` | sk-prompt skill source: §3 enhancement pipeline, §7 `@prompt-improver` contract |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-84-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-85-### Implementation And Test Anchors\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-86-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-87-| File | Role |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-88-|---|---|\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-89-| `../../references/depth-framework.md` | DEPTH phase definitions and mandatory exit criteria |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-90-| `../../references/patterns-evaluation.md` | CLEAR scoring reference used at Test phase |\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/depth-five-phases-order.md-91-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-7-# SP-014 -- Phase exit gates block advancement\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-8-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-9-This document captures the realistic user-testing contract, current behavior, execution flow, source anchors, and metadata for `SP-014`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-10-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-11----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-12-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-13-## 1. OVERVIEW\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-14-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:15:This scenario validates that every DEPTH phase has named exit criteria and that failed criteria block advancement. The operator improves a SQL-query prompt and asks `@prompt-improver` to show each gate as it runs.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-16-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-17-### Why This Matters\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-18-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-19-Without exit gates, DEPTH becomes a narration layer instead of an enforcement mechanism. Blocking criteria make quality failures visible before delivery.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-20-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-21----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-22-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-23-## 2. SCENARIO CONTRACT\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-24-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-25-Operators run the exact prompt and command sequence for `SP-014` and confirm the expected signals without contradictory evidence.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-26-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-27-- Objective: Confirm every DEPTH phase has named exit criteria and cannot advance until its gate passes or re-runs.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-28-- Real user request: `I want to see the DEPTH process show me each phase's exit criteria as it runs — make my SQL query prompt better.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-29-- Prompt: `Improve my SQL query prompt; verify every DEPTH phase reports exit criteria and failed gates block or rerun before advancing.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:30:- Expected execution process: `@prompt-improver` logs each phase, its criterion, status, and any re-run reason before moving on.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-31-- Expected signals: Five gate rows; statuses are `passed`, `re-ran`, or `blocked`; no phase starts after a failed predecessor without remediation.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-32-- Desired user-visible outcome: Gate-status table followed by the enhanced SQL prompt.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-33-- Pass/fail: PASS if all five named gates appear and failures are remediated; FAIL if gates are missing, unnamed, or ignored.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-34-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-35----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-36-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-37-## 3. TEST EXECUTION\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-38-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-40-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-41-```\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-42-Improve my SQL query prompt; verify every DEPTH phase reports exit criteria and failed gates block or rerun before advancing.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-43-```\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-44-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-45-### Commands\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-46-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-47-1. `sk-prompt: I want to see the DEPTH process show me each phase's exit criteria as it runs — make my SQL query prompt better.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md:48:2. `agent: @prompt-improver raw_task=\\\"Improve a SQL query prompt and report every DEPTH phase exit gate.\\\" task_type=generation target_cli=opencode complexity_hint=7 constraints=\\\"Include gate name, status, and remediation for each phase.\\\"`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-49-3. `bash: rg 'Phase Exit Criteria|Exit:' .opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/references/depth-framework.md`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-50-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-51-### Expected\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-52-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-53-The report includes five phase gates and shows that advancement only occurs after `passed` or `re-ran then passed`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-54-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-55-### Evidence\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-56-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-exit-gate-blocking.md-60-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/phase-e