or justifies Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, and Examples.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-16-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-17-### Why This Matters\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-18-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-19-RICCE omissions create prompts that look polished but fail in handoff. The gate makes missing structure visible and recoverable.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-20-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-21----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-22-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-23-## 2. SCENARIO CONTRACT\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-24-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-25-Operators run the exact prompt and command sequence for `SP-012` and confirm the expected signals without contradictory evidence.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-26-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-27-- Objective: Confirm all RICCE elements are present or explicitly justified before delivery.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-28-- Real user request: `Make my onboarding prompt for new engineers more rigorous — I want explicit role, instructions, context, constraints, and examples.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-29-- Prompt: `Strengthen my new-engineer onboarding prompt; verify the final output accounts for Role, Instructions, Context, Constraints, and Examples.`\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md:30:- Expected execution process: `@prompt-improver` runs DEPTH, validates RICCE in Prototype/Harmonize, and blocks silent omissions.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-31-- Expected signals: Five RICCE rows; each row is `present` or `omitted with reason`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-32-- Desired user-visible outcome: Enhanced onboarding prompt plus `RICCE: Role=present, Instructions=present, Context=present, Constraints=present, Examples=present`.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-33-- Pass/fail: PASS if all 5 RICCE elements are present or justified; FAIL if any element is missing without explanation.\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-34-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-35----\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-36-\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-37-## 3. TEST EXECUTION\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/ricce-validation-gate.md-38-\\n--\\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-improve/manual-testing-playbook/depth-clear-loop/r