{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791658856805,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74cf1ffePOKstMD2z8jRCa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_hqg6TTr0lJkmXOZ4qqqG1825","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"echo \"RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH=$RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH\"; ls -la .ripgreprc 2>/dev/null; echo \"--- variant1: default, same globs as master ---\"; rg -l -i -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!.git/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' . 2>&1 | wc -l; echo \"exit=$?\"; echo \"--- variant2: no-ignore same globs ---\"; rg --no-ignore -l -i -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!.git/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' --glob '!.worktrees/**' --glob '!barter/**' . 2>&1 | wc -l; echo \"exit=$?\"; echo \"--- variant3: no-ignore + hidden ---\"; rg --no-ignore --hidden -l -i -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!.git/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' --glob '!.worktrees/**' --glob '!barter/**' . 2>&1 | wc -l; echo \"exit=$?\"; echo \"--- BARTER.md ---\"; head -20 BARTER.md 2>/dev/null"},"output":"RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH=\n--- variant1: default, same globs as master ---\n     282\nexit=0\n--- variant2: no-ignore same globs ---\n       2\nexit=0\n--- variant3: no-ignore + hidden ---\n     420\nexit=0\n--- BARTER.md ---\n# Barter AI Assistant Framework\n\n> **Behavior framework** for Barter's multi-stack ecosystem (Go, Angular, React Native, Python) — enforcing guardrails, code standards, and decision protocols across all repositories.\n\n---\n\n### Multi-Repository Architecture\n\n**Universal Framework:** This AGENTS.md is shared across ALL Barter repositories. The same rules, gates, and workflows apply everywhere — `sk-code` detects the active Barter repo and loads its patterns, and `sk-git` enforces Barter's read-only Git Operations Policy.\n\n**Supported Repositories:**\n\n| Repository                 | Stack             | Detection Marker  | Key Patterns                                    |\n| ----------------------------| -------------------| -------------------| -------------------------------------------------|\n| **backend-system**         | Go                | `go.mod`          | Domain layers, repositories, table-driven tests |\n| **fe-partners-app**        | Angular           | `angular.json`    | Standalone components, signals, RxJS            |\n| **barter-expo**            | React Native/Expo | `app.json` + expo | Hooks, navigation, native modules               |\n| **gaia-services**          | Python/Flask      | `pyproject.toml`  | Blueprints, SQLAlchemy, pytest                  |\n| **fe-backoffice-app**      | Angular           | `angular.json`    | Standalone components, signals, RxJS            |\n| **bartender**              | Go                | `go.mod`          | API gateway, middleware, routing                |\n","metadata":{"output":"RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH=\n--- variant1: default, same globs as master ---\n     282\nexit=0\n--- variant2: no-ignore same globs ---\n       2\nexit=0\n--- variant3: no-ignore + hidden ---\n     420\nexit=0\n--- BARTER.md ---\n# Barter AI Assistant Framework\n\n> **Behavior framework** for Barter's multi-stack ecosystem (Go, Angular, React Native, Python) — enforcing guardrails, code standards, and decision protocols across all repositories.\n\n---\n\n### Multi-Repository Architecture\n\n**Universal Framework:** This AGENTS.md is shared across ALL Barter repositories. The same rules, gates, and workflows apply everywhere — `sk-code` detects the active Barter repo and loads its patterns, and `sk-git` enforces Barter's read-only Git Operations Policy.\n\n**Supported Repositories:**\n\n| Repository                 | Stack             | Detection Marker  | Key Patterns                                    |\n| ----------------------------| -------------------| -------------------| -------------------------------------------------|\n| **backend-system**         | Go                | `go.mod`          | Domain layers, repositories, table-driven tests |\n| **fe-partners-app**        | Angular           | `angular.json`    | Standalone components, signals, RxJS            |\n| **barter-expo**            | React Native/Expo | `app.json` + expo | Hooks, navigation, native modules               |\n| **gaia-services**          | Python/Flask      | `pyproject.toml`  | Blueprints, SQLAlchemy, pytest                  |\n| **fe-backoffice-app**      | Angular           | `angular.json`    | Standalone components, signals, RxJS            |\n| **bartender**              | Go                | `go.mod`          | API gateway, middleware, routing                |\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"echo \"RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH=$RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH\"; ls -la .ripgreprc 2>/dev/null; echo \"--- variant1: default, same globs as master ---\"; rg -l -i -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!.git/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' . 2>&1 | wc -l; echo \"exit=$?\"; echo \"--- variant2: no-ignore same globs ---\"; rg --no-ignore -l -i -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!.git/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' --glob '!.worktrees/**' --glob '!barter/**' . 2>&1 | wc -l; echo \"exit=$?\"; echo \"--- variant3: no-ignore + hidden ---\"; rg --no-ignore --hidden -l -i -e \"model[-_ ]?benchmark\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!.git/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' --glob '!.worktrees/**' --glob '!barter/**' . 2>&1 | wc -l; echo \"exit=$?\"; echo \"--- BARTER.md ---\"; head -20 BARTER.md 2>/dev/null","time":{"start":1791658847343,"end":1791658856803}},"id":"prt_127306920001Fa4zq39DWCs304","sessionID":"ses_ed8e74cf1ffePOKstMD2z8jRCa","messageID":"msg_1273034a0001AdkNGlClGVs2kZ"}}
