{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791658964534,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74cf1ffePOKstMD2z8jRCa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01_5fmYsudkCRuGrESzyi9h4001","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":10,\"run\":10,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1791657286793-xs8psf\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1791657286793-xs8psf\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1791657286793-xs8psf\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.85,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Validators and doctor checks, hub playbook/feature-catalog residual pages, corpus-manifest capture, strict dual-mode gap sweep with residual reconciliation\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"noveltyJustification\":\"7 of 10 findings are new (BARTER.md, compiled dist, sandboxes, hub playbook/catalog pages, corpus lines); 3 consolidate prior surface checks.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which deep-loop hub registries and metadata files reference the model-benchmark mode, and how is each reference classified (DELETE vs EDIT)?\",\"Which .skilled/commands/deep surfaces and deep-improvement packet files implement the model-benchmark mode?\",\"How is model-benchmark wired into system-skill-advisor and sk-doc surfaces (projections, aliases, drift guards, sk-create-benchmark)?\",\"Which runtime mirrors (.claude .opencode .codex .cursor .pi .devin .hermes) and repo-level surfaces (hooks, bin/, scripts, READMEs, changelogs, env examples) reference the mode, and is each a symlink, a generated copy, or a hand-written file?\",\"Which indirect wiring (compiled contracts, generated mirrors, drift guards, tests, fixtures, validators, doctor checks) covers the mode's surfaces, and does anything outside the repository consume the mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Doctor or validator edits (no mode references)\",\"Hand-editing compiled dist or sandbox artifacts\",\"Escalating cite-drift-redirects.json (spec-tree history)\"],\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-deep-loop.yaml\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/fixtures/corpus-manifest.json\",\"BARTER.md\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/dist/runtime/lib/scorer/explicit.js\",\".skilled/bin/tests/.sandboxes/\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-10T19:02:08Z\",\"durationMs\":182000}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter010-001\",\"label\":\"Doctor commands carry no model-benchmark reference; doctor-deep-loop.yaml is generic -> no edit, but doctor runs remain in the post-deletion verification plan\",\"iteration\":10,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-deep-loop.yaml\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter010-002\",\"label\":\"Among runtime scripts/*.cjs only append-mode-event.cjs carries the mode; check-contract-drift, check-documentation-drift, check-ledger-stem-producers, check-projection-coverage, check-protocol-append-sites, verify-authority, compile-command-contracts are generic -> no edits; they are the post-deletion gates\",\"iteration\":10,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/check-projection-coverage.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter010-003\",\"label\":\"Hub playbook: manual-testing-playbook.md:39,160-161,232 EDIT; improvement-lane-routing/model-benchmark.md DELETE; advisor-integration/command-bridge-guard.md:17-78 EDIT; no-false-fire-code-edit.md:41 EDIT\",\"iteration\":10,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter010-004\",\"label\":\"Hub feature-catalog: feature-catalog.md:15,35 EDIT; deep-loop-mode-classificatio